<title>CANADA: Serenpet to buy up to 5 pct of its shares.</title>
<headline>Serenpet to buy up to 5 pct of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Serenpet Inc said on Wednesday it intended to buy back up to 1.1 million, or five percent, of its shares in a normal course issuer bid.</p>
<p>Serenpet said the maximum investment would not exceed C$5 million.</p>
<p>The company said the bid would begin two days after it received regulatory approval and end no later than Oct 18, 1997.</p>
<p>Serenpet said it purchased 368,300 of its shares during the past 12 months at an average price of C$3.35 per share.</p>
<p>The company currently has about 22 million issued and outstanding shares.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
